- [Command Parameter API] 'long' parameter
- [Entity API] Taking damage
- [Entity API] #detach()
- Entity#damage(...) fixes
- Remove faulty fluid group optimization
- [World API] Do null-checking in #eachEntity(...)
- Use `registerSingle` instead of `register` for new number types in CommandParameters
- [Entity API] #kill()
- [Entity API] Use floats instead of ints in the damage functions
- Some API status notes
- [Entity API] #isSilent()
- [Entity API] Make the damage methods final in custom entities
- [Command Parameter API] Clarify `registerSingle` warning
- [Entity API] #getDefaultGravity()
- [Entity API] #jumpFromGround()
- [Entity API] #isPersistenceRequired()
- [Entity API] #{ canPickUpLoot, setCanPickUpLoot }()
- [Server API] #eachEntity([Consumer<Entity>] callback)
- [Server API] #stopServer()
- [Entity API] Merchant subclass
- [Entity Creation API] Merchant subclass
- [Entity Type Creation API] Error detection
